"Device status object containing device_id\"}}, \"required\": [\"device_status\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_light_bridge_payload_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a bridge-native light payload including bridge light id, bridge state, dimmer, and tone.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"device_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Smart-light identifier\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\"]}}, \"required\": [\"device_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_light_mesh_snapshot_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a mesh-native light snapshot including mesh node, lamp state, level percentage, and hue name.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"light_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Smart-light identifier\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\"]}}, \"required\": [\"light_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"query_connected_devices\", \"description\": \"Query connected smart devices within a specific home area using the SmartHome Query API.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"area\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The area name to search (e.g., 'bedroom')\", \"enum\": [\"living_room\", \"bedroom\"]}, \"device_type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Filter by device type (e.g., 'light', 'thermostat')\", \"default\": \"\"}}, \"required\": [\"area\"]}}, {\"name\": \"restart_device\", \"description\": \"Perform a hard restart of an IoT device. Useful for recovering from 'offline' or 'not responding' states.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"device_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target device ID to reboot (default: 'ac_bedroom')\", \"enum\": [\"lock_main\", \"lock_bedroom\", \"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\", \"ac_living\", \"ac_bedroom\", \"tv_living\", \"sensor_bedroom_window\", \"tv_bedroom\"]}}, \"required\": [\"device_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"snapshot_workspace_and_alert\", \"description\": \"Create a backup of a work